    "detailed_description": "Pandemic Violence is an exaggerated take on the world dealing with a deadly pandemic virus. Play through 10 levels at critical points during the pandemic spanning hundreds of years. As the title says, violence is the central point during this pandemic, so expect to get your hands dirty. Beat down citizens taken their gold, kill your neighbors for a roll of toilet paper, and plenty more scenarios like that.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Third Person Melee &amp; Ranged Combat<br />\r\n*Each level focused on a different person &amp; goal<br />\r\n*Each level contains a hidden item<br />\r\n*Levels ranged from current-day themes to sci-fi settings<br />\r\n*Level goals range from collecting items, killing targets, infecting targets, &amp; bypassing security<br />\r\n*No inventory or stat management &amp; use/drop weapons<br />\r\n*Exploration available but not required<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe overall theme takes a comedic approach to how humanity handles situations, the priorities world governments take, and the price humanity pays.",
    "about_the_game": "Pandemic Violence is an exaggerated take on the world dealing with a deadly pandemic virus. Play through 10 levels at critical points during the pandemic spanning hundreds of years. As the title says, violence is the central point during this pandemic, so expect to get your hands dirty. Beat down citizens taken their gold, kill your neighbors for a roll of toilet paper, and plenty more scenarios like that.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Third Person Melee &amp; Ranged Combat<br />\r\n*Each level focused on a different person &amp; goal<br />\r\n*Each level contains a hidden item<br />\r\n*Levels ranged from current-day themes to sci-fi settings<br />\r\n*Level goals range from collecting items, killing targets, infecting targets, &amp; bypassing security<br />\r\n*No inventory or stat management &amp; use/drop weapons<br />\r\n*Exploration available but not required<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe overall theme takes a comedic approach to how humanity handles situations, the priorities world governments take, and the price humanity pays.",
